=================================================================================
KEY T-SQL TO POSTGRESQL CONVERSIONS
=================================================================================
1. GETDATE() → NOW() - Applied to 7 locations
2. SCOPE_IDENTITY() → RETURNING clause - Documented for InsertProductAsync
3. DECLARE @Variable → Handled in application code - UpdateProductAsync, DeleteProductAsync
4. BEGIN TRANSACTION/COMMIT → NpgsqlTransaction - Handled by Npgsql driver
5. Window Functions (AVG, COUNT, LAG, RANK, PERCENT_RANK, MIN, MAX) → Compatible (no changes needed)
6. CTEs (WITH clause) → Compatible (no changes needed)
7. CASE expressions → Compatible (no changes needed)

